---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy" seo={{ page_description: "Privacy policy for UConvertDocument." }}>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-16 prose">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Your privacy is important to us. This privacy policy explains how we handle your data.</p>
    <h2>File Uploads</h2>
    <p>When you upload a file for conversion, it is temporarily stored on our secure servers for processing. Once the conversion is complete and you have downloaded your file, the original and converted files are permanently deleted from our servers.</p>
    <h2>Data Collection</h2>
    <p>We may collect non-personally identifiable information such as your IP address, browser type, and usage statistics to improve our service.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
